cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or these results, please cite the paper."
title: "Anabolic failure, not catabolic activation, underlies glycogen depletion in cervical carcinogenesis: a multi-cohort transcriptomic analysis"
abstract: >-
  Glycogen depletion in cervical carcinogenesis reflects failure of a
  tissue-restricted synthetic axis, GYS2 and PPP1R3C, within a collapsing
  squamous differentiation programme, not catabolic activation. All four
  candidate mechanisms were measured on one scale in the same specimens across
  four public cohorts, two array chemistries and three specimen preparations.
authors:
